      "id": "construct-texture",
      "name": "ConstructTexture",
      "category": "TextureRenderTarget",
      "signature": "ConstructTexture(Target, In Outer, In New Texture Name, In Object Flags, In Flags, In Alpha Override, Out Error Message)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UTextureRenderTarget*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Outer",
          "type": "UObject*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In New Texture Name",
          "type": "String&"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Object Flags",
          "type": "EObjectFlags",
          "default": "RF_NoFlags"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Flags",
          "type": "EConstructTextureFlags",
          "default": "CTF_Default"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Alpha Override",
          "type": "TArray<uint8>*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Error Message",
          "type": "Text*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UTexture*",
      "docs": "Utility for creating a new UTexture from a UTextureRenderTarget. The method can fail if conversion is impossible\n@param InOuter - Outer to use when constructing the new UTexture.\n@param InNewTextureName - Name of new UTexture object.\n@param InObjectFlags - Flags to apply to the new UTexture object\n@param InFlags - Various control flags for operation (see EConstructTextureFlags)\n@param InAlphaOverride - (Optional) the values here will become the alpha values in the resulting texture (8 bits alpha, regardless of the texture's format)\n@param OutErrorMessage - (Optional) Error message in case of failure\n@return New UTexture object."
    },
